Ultimate and one of the largest merchant-ships' database. More then 300K ships in database!
Scanning public resources, collects many data for commercial fleet, such as:
 - ship particulars;
 - deck equipment;
 - engine equipment;
 - radio-communication equipment;
 - vessel position;
 - crew;
 - status;
 - schedules;
 - pictures;
 - seamen reviews; 
 - vacancies.

Searching by name, IMO number or MMSI

Some of functions are working offline.

Available languages:
- English;
- German;
- Danish;
- Russian;
- Ukrainian; 
- Chinese.

Premium subsriptions:
 - Monthly subscription is month-to-month subscripton and charged $0.99 per month;
 - Yearly subscription is year-to-year subscripton and charged $5.99 per year;
- Subscriptions give you access to AIS position an schedule, if available and add vessels in My Fleet;
 - Payment will be charged to iTunes Account at confirmation of purchase. 
 - Your subscription will automatically renew unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24-hours before the end of the current period. 
- Your account will be charged for renewal within 24-hours prior to the end of the current period.
- Subscriptions maybe managed by the user and auto-renewal may be turned off by going to the user’s Account Settings on the device.
- You cannot cancel the current subscription during the active subscription period.

Privacy policy and terms of use: https://www.infoship.xyz/shipinfo/v1/privacy_policy_ios.html

myDua - a pocket collection of prayers for all occasions. With the mobile app myDua you will always know how you should behave and what prayer to use in different situations. 

myDua app is optimized for all models of iPhone / iPad. This means that you will be able to fully enjoy all its beauty and usability.

Functions:

- Quick search by titles and content;
- Audio version of all prayers with ability to clean cache;
- Ability to add prayers to favourites;
- Amazing toolbar which allows to adjust screen brightness, font size and background color;
- Everyday push notification with ability to change time;
- Ability to share prayers with your friends using SMS, e-mail, social networks and messengers.

If you like the app, please leave your review in the App Store, and be sure to share the link with your friends! :)
- - - - -
Please notice that we can not reply to App Store reviews. If you have faced any issue, found a bug or have a great idea of how to make app better - feel fre to email us at support@mydua.me.

«Мой Авто» – бесплатное приложение для записи и обслуживания автомобиля

Удобная запись на ремонт всех марок авто: Toyota, Volkswagen, Hyundai, Škoda, Chevrolet, BMW, Renault, Chevrolet, Kia, Ford, Nissan, Skoda, Audi, VAZ и др. Укажите в приложении нужную услугу, дату и время. Из 20 проверенных автосервисов выберите лучший, по выгодной цене.

Помощник автовладельцу:
- история ремонтов автомобиля расходы,
- напоминания техобслуживания,
- расход топлива,
- запись в ближайший автосервис онлайн,
- электронная сервисная книжка.

Бесплатный автоэксперт заменит тысячу бумаг и номеров телефонов. В нем вы найдете:
- напоминания о ремонтах
- напоминания по дате и/или пробегу
- информация по обслуживанию автомобиля расходы,
- карта ближайших автосервисов,
- проверенные автосервисы в “Избранном”
- сохранение и ведение учета всех работ, производимых с 
  автомобилем: ремонт подвески, ремонт двигателя,
- синхронизация данных в сервисную книжку из заказ-нарядов, 
  созданных в автосервисах - партнерах.

Наши автосервисы-партнёры – проверенные СТО, оказывающие целый ряд услуг:
- ТО авто;
- ремонт машины;
- страхование ОСАГО.
- автомойка;
- заправка;
- замена шин;
- диагностика автомобиля;
- помощь в дороге;
- вызов эвакуатора;
- замена масла;
- замена фильтров;
- замена антифриза;
- замена тормозной жидкости;

В ближайших обновлениях - добавление расходов с помощью распознавания чеков.

ZEN.CAR разрабатывает цифровое ПО для СТО и клиентов, знаем как все работает изнутри, ориентируемся на отзывы и потребности клиентов, техподдержка всегда на связи.

myQuran application is your universal assistant, which allows you to benefit from reading and listening to the Quran. myQuran will always be at your fingertips, wherever you are.

Features:

— Translation into 25 languages;
— Tafsir - interpretation of the Quran;
— Original Quran text with tajweed rules;
— Detailed information for each surah;
— Screen with Ajza;
— Easy to use and functional audio player;
— Ability to play each ayah separately (for 11 recitors);
— Interactive surah and ayah search; 
— Ability to add ayahs to favourites;
— Bookmarks;
— Custom font and font sizes;
— Quick access toolbar on the main screen;
— Ability to delete cached audio files;
— Customizable notifications;
— 3D touch support;

Please keep in mind, that you can share ayahs using e-mail, SMS, Facebook, Twitter, WhatsApp, Telegram, VK and other social networks. 

The application allows you to listen to Quran recitation with the voices of the best reciters in the world. Such as: Abdul Baset Abdus Samad; Abdul Rahman al-Sudais; Abdullah Awad al-Juhani; Abdullah Ibn Ali Basfar; Abu Bakr ash-Shatri; Ahmad bin Ali al-Ajmi; Emad al-Mansary; Hani ar-Rifai; Maher al-Muaiqly; Mahmood al-Rifai; Mahmoud Khalil al-Hussary; Mishari Rashid al-Afasy; Muhammad al-Luhaidan; Muhammad al-Minshawi; Nasser al-Qatami; Saad al-Ghamdi; Salah Abdul Rahman Bukhatir; Salah al-Budair; Salah al-Hashim; Saud al-Shuraim; Tawfeeq al-Sayegh; Yasser al-Dosari.

Please write your reviews and suggestions to support@myquran.me. We appreciate your opinion!
